cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "Si usas este software, cítalo con estos metadatos. If you use this software, please cite it using these metadata."
title: "Cobb coronal en RM lumbar sagital: reproducción abierta y prueba de robustez"
abstract: >-
  Research-only, open and independent reproduction of automated coronal Cobb
  angle measurement on routine sagittal lumbar MRI, using the public SPIDER
  dataset, with a robustness analysis across slice thickness, sequence and
  acquisition site. Not a medical device; not for diagnosis.
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: "Nossa Díaz"
    given-names: "Edwar Fabian"
